@startuml
[*] --> CreateProfile : User starts
CreateProfile --> ProfileCreated : Profile created
CreateProfile --> Login : User logs in
Login --> ProfileLoaded : Profile loaded
ProfileLoaded --> ProfileViewed : View profile
ProfileViewed --> ProfileUpdated : Update profile
ProfileViewed --> ProfileDeleted : Delete profile
ProfileViewed --> ProfileSettings : Manage settings
ProfileViewed --> SearchResults : Search users
ProfileSettings --> ProfileViewed : Settings updated
SearchResults --> ProfileViewed : Return to profile
SearchResults --> ViewOtherProfile : View other profile
ProfileUpdated --> ProfileViewed : Profile updated
ProfileDeleted --> [*] : Profile deleted
@enduml
